    "id": "5k_training_novice",
    "name": "5K Training: Novice",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "The following 5K novice training program lasts eight weeks and climaxes at the end of Week 8 with a 5K (3.1 mile) race. It is among the easiest programs I offer both online and in books. If you are a beginning runner, just about to take your first running step, this is the program for ... Continue reading \"Novice\"",
